==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|force-out}}, {{l|en|forceout}} {{qualifier|noun}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[force]] [[out]]|forces out|forcing out|forced out}}

# To cause something to be ejected
#: ''We are going to '''force out''' intolerance.''
# {{label|en|baseball}} To create an [[out]] by touching a [[base]] in advance of a runner who has no base to return to while in possession of a [[ball]] which has already touched the ground
#: ''Jones '''forced out''' Smith to end the inning.''

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[force]] [[out]]}}

# {{label|en|baseball}} An instance of an out created by touching a [[base]] in advance of a runner who has no base to return to while in possession of a [[ball]] which has already touched the ground.
#: ''A '''force out''' was recorded on the scorecard.''

